    "instructions": "1. In a rocks glass, gently muddle mint with simple syrup to release oils.\n2. Add lemon pieces and muddle to release juice.\n3. Add crushed ice or small ice cubes and pour bourbon over.\n4. Swizzle gently to mix.\n5. Garnish with a mint spring and lemon wheel.",
